Aurora is the center’s flagship SoC effort and the main proving ground for tape-out methodology.

The current branch integrates a secure boot path, a dual-port scratchpad, and a bus fabric built for timing closure on the target process node.


```verilog
module pipeline_top (
  input  logic        clk,
  input  logic        rst_n,
  output logic [31:0] trace
);
  always_ff @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin
    if (!rst_n) begin
      trace <= '0;
    end else begin
      trace <= trace + 32'd1;
    end
  end
endmodule
```


